Themes: '''gold''' (cinder gold (the default)), '''ember''' (fire and forges), '''frost''' (ice and the north), '''verdant''' (forests, plants, nature), '''arcane''' (magic and sorcery), '''blood''' (bosses, danger, war), '''abyss''' (sea, depths, the unknown), '''holy''' (holy, light, temples), '''shadow''' (stealth, ruins, the dead), '''plague''' (poison, rot, swamps). Single components can still use their own <code>theme=</code>.

'''Result:'''

(Changes this page's accent colour.)


